1
00:01:57,125 --> 00:02:13,035
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,119
Come on then!

3
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:23,759
The Eternal!
A grand migration is coming from the steppe...

4
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:27,999
...it's hard to carry the burden for the helpless.

5
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:32,359
The young lead the way, the old come later.

6
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:36,879
Make way! A hennaed sheep is coming on shoulders!

7
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,479
Come on then!

8
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:41,759
Let's see who's the fastest in the tribe!

9
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,839
In the name of Allah!

10
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,679
Come on!

11
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,279
Come on!

12
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,479
Come on Alps!

13
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:17,599
Aykurt!

14
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,359
Come on, my Shahzade!

15
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,879
Come on Alps!

16
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,639
Come on, come on!

17
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,199
Turahan, hang on!

18
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,759
Be careful!

19
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,279
Come on

20
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:32,239
I let you win because you have a wedding, brother.

21
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,679
Or else, I'd win.

22
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,919
Yes sure!

23
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,479
My children...

24
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,039
Of people!

25
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,399
From the horse, a stallion...

26
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,519
...from the sheep, a ram, from the camel...

27
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,959
..a bullock will be sacrificed

28
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:58,279
Now spread the news to all our cities!

29
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:01,879
Food will be distributed for
forty days and forty nights!

30
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,079
May Allah bless you, my Bey!

31
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:11,639
May Allah bless you too.
May Allah bless you too.

32
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,159
What happened, Alaeddin?

33
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,199
Why are you standing there, my son?

34
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:25,759
Don't worry. Soon, we will
organize your wedding as well.

35
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:29,399
We will take Gonca for you, my son.

36
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,279
Then...

37
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,319
...then you will defeat your brother in the game.

38
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:39,559
I hope so my Bey.
May my Allah show us those days.

39
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,519
Aameen.

40
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,959
So...

41
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:49,839
If those fitna causers and
dastards do not stop us...

42
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,319
...we will see those days with Allah's permission.

43
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:08,399
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

44
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,799
Welcome, father.

45
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,119
Isn't my mother here?

46
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,439
You know how we left this place, Mehmed.

47
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:45,479
She didn't want to come
back and see Osman's Hatuns.

48
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,959
They will take the dowries to Sinop.

49
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,479
You tell me.

50
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,319
Where is that traitor, your sister?

51
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:58,559
I put her in the caged tent, father.

52
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:01,999
To stop her from making a mistake and running away.

53
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,319
Gonca..

54
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,159
Go.

55
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,439
My Alaeddin..

56
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,479
I am determined for this love.

57
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,519
I'll keep my word.

58
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,439
Will you keep yours too?

59
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,359
Alaeddin

60
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:40,799
Father!

61
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,999
Father, thanks to Allah! You came!

62
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,199
Father, thanks to Allah! You..

63
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,879
Who are you to..

64
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:53,839
...disregard my orders and do what you want?

65
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,879
Gonca...

66
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,479
Is this the girl I raised?

67
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,079
Father, I..

68
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:13,719
While I was struggling for
the well-being of the state...

69
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,959
...worrying about our future...

70
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:21,319
...you went and fell in love
with my enemy's son, huh?

71
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,079
My daughter...

72
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,199
...does what is necessary...

73
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:32,599
...for the well-being of the state.

74
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:36,999
-She will marry Candaroglu Ahmet.
-Enough, father!

75
00:08:37,558 --> 00:08:39,599
I can think clearly!

76
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,158
I love Alaeddin Bey.

77
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:46,159
No matter what..

78
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:50,879
...I will die, but I will never marry someone else!
-Shut up!

79
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:03,399
You will marry Candaroglu Ahmet.

80
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:07,399
Soon, your fiance will be here.

81
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:09,399
Go and make yourself presentable.

82
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,639
You used to get mad at my mother.

83
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:17,119
But power has blinded you, father.

84
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,479
Father...

85
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:28,599
I don't know you anymore..

86
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:33,279
It's you who is blind to the truth.

87
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,959
But...

88
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:40,839
But I know how to open your blind eyes.

89
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,759
If you make a mistake,

90
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:48,639
If you disgrace me

91
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:51,359
...I swear...

92
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:56,439
...I will burn both you and Alaaddin.

93
00:09:57,440 --> 00:10:00,919
Get out of my sight!

94
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,359
The biggest obstacle against us...

95
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:24,919
...is the alliance between
Candaroglu and Germiyanoglu.

96
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:28,999
They're both setting up games
and joining the wedding, my Bey.

97
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:34,719
They know you won't accept gifts
but only demand loyalty from the beys.

98
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:39,159
Yes, they do. They'll attempt to divert the beys.

99
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:43,119
-They'll come to show off.
-Yakup Bey...

100
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:45,839
...always does things secretly, my Bey.

101
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:50,159
Still, we'll try to break their alliance
without shedding the brother's blood.

102
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,599
Continue the preparations for Mekece, though.

103
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:56,439
No matter what they do, we won't stop conquering.

104
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,279
My Bey!

105
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:02,919
We got a message.

106
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:18,479
They located Konur. Konur...

107
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:22,479
...is going to pay for the gold that he stole.

108
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,479
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

109
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:28,279
You stay in the tribe. There'll be
people who come to the wedding.

110
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,519
-Be cautious.
-As you order, my Bey.

111
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:33,839
-Aladdin, you go to the frontier market.
-My Bey.

112
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:37,919
Welcome Yakup Bey there. And smell the air.

113
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:42,319
-Get some information.
-As you order, my Bey.

114
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:49,119
Konur's fate won't be different from a criminal.

115
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,479
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

116
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,439
Tell the alps...

117
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:57,479
If anyone steps back from fighting,
I will sign their death warrants.

118
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,559
Come on.

119
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:41,719
Allah has given me whatever I wanted from Him.

120
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:48,279
A smart husband and a
son who listens to his mother.

121
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:57,959
Tell me, boy. Did you accomplish your duty?

122
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:01,679
I located Konur Bey, one of Osman Bey's alps.

123
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:08,679
Good boy.

124
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:15,239
Konur will be the key of my
sovereignty in the frontiers.

125
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:19,959
I will hold him in my hands first.

126
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:28,039
See? Your father intends to crush
the foreign lands before stepping on it.

127
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,999
We'll do the same again, mother.

128
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:33,599
I hear your words again...

129
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:38,759
...and ignore what I heard
about Gonca Hatun and Alaaddin.

130
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:43,839
You still see this matter as a duty.

131
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:47,399
Gonca Hatun is going to be your wife!

132
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:50,479
Our beylic's honor is your honor.

133
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:53,639
Fathers agreed and there will be a marriage.

134
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:59,159
You say I shouldn't show
mercy if Alaaddin crosses the line.

135
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:03,239
-You shouldn't.
-I won't, mother.

136
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:07,479
I won't.

137
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:19,639
Are you picking up the ripe fruits, husband?

138
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:23,679
I won't be bothered to
bend if it's valuable, hatun.

139
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:28,279
What matters to me is the
future of Candaroglu family.

140
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,159
This marriage...

141
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:35,519
...will make us much more powerful than before.

142
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,519
-I know, father.
-You know.

143
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:42,799
You know but you should also know this.

144
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:48,479
You father takes measures and plans his every move.

145
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:52,839
If you show weakness it will be pity for us.

146
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:55,239
If this marriage doesn't happen

147
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:58,039
...there will be no Germiyan or Candar.

148
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:01,319
All of us will be subject to Ottomans.

149
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:04,479
-May Allah forbid that.
-Now...

150
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:07,559
Everyone should do their own duties.

151
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:12,039
You go to the frontier market
and please Yakup Bey's mind...

152
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:15,679
..and Gonca Hatun's heart.

153
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:19,519
I'll take care of this matter
and join you afterwards.

154
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,919
-Come back victorious, my Bey.
-Come on.

155
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:38,799
Who are they, my Bey?

156
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:43,159
-I have never seen them before.
-They are former Seljukian soldiers.

157
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:46,759
Traitors. They loot the caravans in the frontiers.

158
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:50,119
They steal gold.

159
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:53,399
Alps, let's go.

160
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:07,319
-We're under attack.
-Who are those people coming?

161
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:10,039
We'll see.

162
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:17,319
-My Bey, some people are coming.
-Come on, Cerkutay.

163
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:26,039
Find Konur for me.

164
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:29,599
-Is that clear?
-As you order, my Bey.

165
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:42,279
Konur...

166
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,959
Konur...

167
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,719
It's time for you to pay.

168
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:53,879
Run and save your life, Konur.

169
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:57,999
If Osman Bey catches you, he won't let you live.

170
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,839
You must go beyond me first to take Konur!

171
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:07,719
-Who are you?
-Come on, attack!

172
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:56,999
Konur, where are you going?
Where do you think you are going?

173
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:03,239
I've seen many battles and enemies
but never seen Osman Bey so angry.

174
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:06,119
-Come on, brothers!
-There will be a blood bath after this.

175
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:09,919
-Konur Bey will be wasted.
-Come on, come on.

176
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:46,879
Konur!

177
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:51,679
Where are you going? Where
do you think you are going?

178
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:59,479
Where are you going? Where
do you think you are going?

179
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:03,759
Konur... Cerkutay!
-My Bey.

180
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:07,639
Trails go this way. You go that way!

181
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:11,159
Look at me! Bring Konur to me!

182
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:16,359
Whoever steps back from fighting
will pay a heavy price for this!

183
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:21,879
-Bring Konur to me! Come on!
-Come on!

184
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:28,719
If we can't find Konur

185
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:31,799
..our Bey will bury us here
with this anger, brothers.

186
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,479
Right.

187
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,439
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

188
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:17,759
I want no mistakes, Gonca.

189
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:21,559
Act worthy of your family.

190
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:50,559
-Welcome, Melike Hatun.
-Thank you, Yakup Bey.

191
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:53,759
-Ahmed Bey.
-Peace be upon you.

192
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:56,199
Peace be upon you too.

193
00:21:02,120 --> 00:21:06,279
-Where is Ibrahim Bey?
-My father Ibrahim Bey is on his way.

194
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:10,159
He will come to Kayi Tribe when his work is done.

195
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:13,559
Alright then.

196
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:34,119
My girl Gonca.

197
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:38,679
They said you were beautiful, however,
I did not expect it to be this much.

198
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:42,599
Praise be, you are very beautiful.

199
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:46,879
It was our destiny to meet today.

200
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:51,199
-Welcome, Melike Hatun.
-Thank you, my daughter.

201
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:55,599
I can say that you are my daughter now as well.

202
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:03,319
I've heard your fame. You
were running from battle to battle.

203
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:07,799
They say you are acting
a little independent as well.

204
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:13,079
-You know everything about me, is that right?
-What can I say.

205
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:16,359
I am getting a bride to the
mighty Candaroglu, my girl.

206
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:19,599
You came from afar.

207
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:25,119
Here, let us go to our tent.

208
00:22:26,520 --> 00:22:28,839
Please, this way.

209
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:44,519
Wedding caravan is coming!

210
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:50,199
Wedding caravan is coming!

211
00:23:31,760 --> 00:23:34,959
-Welcome, Gunduz Bey.
-Peace be upon you.

212
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:38,559
-Peace be upon you too.
-Peace be upon you too.

213
00:23:39,320 --> 00:23:43,319
-Welcome, Gunduz Bey.
-Thank you.

214
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:50,359
-Welcome, my daughter.
-Thank you, mother Malhun.

215
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:57,159
Congratulations, my daughter.

216
00:23:57,240 --> 00:24:00,399
I hope you always stand behind
each other's back.

217
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:02,679
-I hope so.
-I hope so.

218
00:24:02,800 --> 00:24:06,359
My daughter, come here.

219
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:12,559
Today, these seeds will fall upon the earth.

220
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:15,319
When they grow and spread..

221
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:19,159
..may your house also grow and spread,
if Allah permits.

222
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:24,239
-I hope you always trust each other
-I hope so.

223
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:44,999
Orhan, my son.

224
00:24:45,080 --> 00:24:48,959
This soil is Horasan soil.

225
00:24:49,560 --> 00:24:52,159
Today, the place of your tent will be decided.

226
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:56,559
Spread this soil to the
place where your tent will be.

227
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:58,079
So that..

228
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:00,959
..your children may inherit..

229
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:04,479
..the glorious cause you
inherited from your father.

230
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:08,039
Ameen, Gunduz Bey.

231
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:13,959
-You can trust me with this.
-Praise be, praise be.

232
00:25:21,600 --> 00:25:25,479
I can't see Osman Bey. Where is he?

233
00:25:27,520 --> 00:25:30,239
Our Bey has went to get rid of one of our troubles.

234
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:34,279
-He will come back soon, if Allah permits.
-What is it Orhan Bey?

235
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:39,199
-We could've helped.
-Our Bey didn't think it was necessary.

236
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:43,999
It is about Konur. He did wrong to us.

237
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:49,559
-Come on, let us talk at the tent.
-Come, my daughter.

238
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:28,959
Konur!

239
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:34,479
If you take another step,
I will kill you before you talk!

240
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:49,239
Konur. How could you do this to me?

241
00:27:15,560 --> 00:27:18,119
Get up

242
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:23,599
Get up.

243
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:26,879
Get up!

244
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:29,919
At least stand tall when you are dying!

245
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:32,679
Look at me!

246
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:40,119
Look!

247
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:43,559
Look at me.

248
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:47,279
I banished you instead when
your punishment was death.

249
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:51,039
I banished you.

250
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:54,919
And what did you do?

251
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:58,239
Look at me. You stabbed me from the back.

252
00:27:58,520 --> 00:28:02,439
You stabbed me from the back.

253
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:07,039
Haven't you ate my food and drink from my water?

254
00:28:07,120 --> 00:28:10,679
Haven't you!

255
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:16,319
Answer me. Answer me!

256
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:21,639
I only do what I know, my Bey.

257
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:25,879
Come here. Is this what I taught you?

258
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:32,359
Did I teach you infamy! Is
this what you are saying?

259
00:28:32,760 --> 00:28:36,719
The wound you opened still stays.

260
00:28:37,120 --> 00:28:41,839
I forgave you despite all you
did. I've known you as family.

261
00:28:41,960 --> 00:28:46,479
I put you at the head of my
army. And what did you do?

262
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:50,719
What did you do to me? Now..

263
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:56,239
-..you will tell me why you betrayed me.
-I do everything for holy war.

264
00:28:56,840 --> 00:29:00,199
I never went off my path.

265
00:29:00,560 --> 00:29:07,239
-By stealing State's gold?
-I only followed this path for holy war.

266
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:12,239
-This is my way.
-Still talking about holy war.

267
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:15,439
Get up! He still says holy war!

268
00:29:15,520 --> 00:29:20,359
The right of oppressed is the State's gold!

269
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:23,839
Who gave you this authority? Who?

270
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:28,439
-Tell me, who?
-Count those coins..

271
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:35,159
..as payment for the lands, my Bey. I
had sword's right for those lands as well.

272
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:40,679
I will spend those gold and
my life for the sake of holy war.

273
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:49,599
Is that so.

274
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:54,839
I gave you those lands.

275
00:29:56,640 --> 00:30:01,719
And I will take them from you.

276
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:08,359
Your life is in my hands as well.
I will not let you have it as well.

277
00:30:17,360 --> 00:30:20,119
These cloths..

278
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:25,879
..has been brought from India
and Damascus for you only.

279
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:32,119
However, it seems you didn't like them.

280
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,639
I didn't, Ahmed Bey.

281
00:30:33,760 --> 00:30:37,359
If you are looking to impress a
woman with couple of clothing..

282
00:30:37,560 --> 00:30:40,639
..you can wander this marketplace.

283
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:42,599
We are engaged now.

284
00:30:43,760 --> 00:30:48,079
I am not searching for anyone
other than you, Gonca Hatun.

285
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:53,359
However, I knew I would get this
response, you didn't surprise me.

286
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:16,639
For you to decorate your beauty.

287
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:41,479
You do not want this marriage. I know that.

288
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:48,439
However, this marriage..

289
00:31:48,520 --> 00:31:51,199
..is a duty for both of us now.

290
00:31:56,520 --> 00:32:00,559
Who knows, maybe we can know..

291
00:32:00,800 --> 00:32:03,399
..each other-

292
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:07,039
Gonca?

293
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:12,679
Alaeddin.

294
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:22,479
It seems Osman Bey sent him to escort.

295
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:28,319
Come on!

296
00:32:51,840 --> 00:32:56,879
Yakup Bey. Melike Hatun.

297
00:32:58,560 --> 00:33:02,559
I brought salutations from my father. Welcome.

298
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:07,119
All precautions are taken on the roads.

299
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:10,999
We will escort you.

300
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:17,439
Fitnat. Finish your business with Gonca.

301
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:24,799
We will be on the road afterall.

302
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:41,039
Your father thinks of everything.

303
00:33:41,120 --> 00:33:44,879
He sends you to us. Tell me..

304
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:48,399
..how can he let Imren have..

305
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:52,159
..my lands, my marketplace!

306
00:33:52,320 --> 00:33:55,919
Mehmed Bey must've told you everything, Yakup Bey.

307
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:58,959
We set up a trap to defeat Imren.

308
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:04,559
We killed Imren and we took back the marketplace.

309
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:08,839
It is not about giving or taking, Alaeddin Bey.

310
00:34:09,080 --> 00:34:12,839
It is about setting up traps on Yakup Bey's land..

311
00:34:13,159 --> 00:34:17,958
..without his knowledge.

312
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:21,918
It seems you don't know how this works, Ahmed Bey.

313
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:24,279
We do not do anything for our personal gain.

314
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:27,799
-Against infidels- -You are right, Alaeddin.

315
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:33,319
However, you did this without
telling me, you didn't trust us.

316
00:34:33,639 --> 00:34:36,119
There was a traitor inside, Mehmed.

317
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:40,119
If there wasn't any, why wouldn't we trust you?

318
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:47,438
Besides, its not like..

319
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:51,478
..you will do any business
and unite behind our back.

320
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:56,958
We are soldiers of the same cause.

321
00:34:57,680 --> 00:35:00,359
Isn't that right, Yakup Bey?

322
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:10,999
I've kept a snake by my side for all these years.

323
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:15,839
I entrusted my family to you,
I entrusted everything to you.

324
00:35:16,040 --> 00:35:19,519
I entrusted my army to you.

325
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:25,639
But you stabbed me in the back.

326
00:35:26,560 --> 00:35:28,679
Now,

327
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:32,359
-tell me where the gold is.
-I did not betray you.

328
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:37,799
Either let me go and I'll become a
martyr and I will be killed by you now.

329
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:41,239
Both is an honor for me.

330
00:35:41,520 --> 00:35:45,839
-This is my last word.
-Wrong move

331
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:50,359
is the killer of the right path.

332
00:35:50,560 --> 00:35:54,279
You will be punished for what you did.

333
00:36:02,680 --> 00:36:05,999
Protect the Bey!

334
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,719
Who are these men?

335
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:08,559
Osman, I'm here to drink blood

336
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:13,479
I'm here to shed blood!

337
00:37:13,640 --> 00:37:17,999
-We're coming my Bey.
-Come on, brothers!

338
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:06,839
Either come with me or die by Osman's hands.

339
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:28,079
My Bey, Konur ran away
and they set the horses free.

340
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:32,959
Konur! Where will you run?

341
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:37,639
My Bey! Who are they? What
do they have to do with Konur?

342
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:42,719
Just a jackal collaborating with Konur.

343
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:48,959
We will kill them all. Come on.

344
00:38:53,040 --> 00:38:58,079
So you were the spy, is that so?
How could you not tell me about it?

345
00:38:58,320 --> 00:39:01,959
My Bey! They had my child and my Hatun.

346
00:39:02,040 --> 00:39:06,199
I had no other choice, my Bey. Forgive me, my Bey.

347
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:10,519
Kanyumaz!
-It's not a big deal, Mehmed.

348
00:39:19,240 --> 00:39:22,119
Kanyumaz sold Osman out.

349
00:39:22,680 --> 00:39:27,959
-He hurt him, not us.
-Osman Bey.

350
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:31,639
He will kill me if he finds out that

351
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:34,159
I was spying for Imren.

352
00:39:34,240 --> 00:39:36,879
You are under my protection, Kanyumaz.

353
00:39:37,080 --> 00:39:40,999
Yes, my Sultan.
-Osman Bey,

354
00:39:41,200 --> 00:39:44,319
can't do anything to you.

355
00:39:46,200 --> 00:39:52,199
From now on, Osman will have even more troubles.

356
00:39:53,520 --> 00:39:55,199
What are you going to do, father?

357
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:59,359
I formed an alliance with the Lord of Mekece.

358
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:02,719
Our trade is going well.

359
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:06,239
When the time comes, we will attack

360
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:11,439
we will take the castle, and when we have Mekece

361
00:40:11,720 --> 00:40:16,079
Bursa and Iznik will be ours as well.

362
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:22,079
Osman's biggest dream

363
00:40:22,200 --> 00:40:24,919
is to have Bursa and Iznik.

364
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:31,039
Osman will never be able to get what he wants.

365
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:35,519
We will conquer them.

366
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:41,199
That's why we made an alliance with Candaroglus.

367
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:47,159
Osman won't let it happen,
father. He will confront us.

368
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:49,919
Neither Osman

369
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:54,079
nor Alaeddin, I will not let any of them

370
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:59,279
break this union and stop us.

371
00:41:04,200 --> 00:41:09,159
From now on, we will not show
mercy to those who stand against us.

372
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:13,799
Osman, Alaeddin, Orhan..

373
00:41:14,040 --> 00:41:18,319
Whoever it is,
we will crush him.

374
00:41:26,040 --> 00:41:31,959
No, it's nowhere to be found.
What am I going to say to my Bey?

375
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:36,479
He's coming. Aykurt.

376
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:47,319
-Baysungur, did you find the gold?
-My Bey.

377
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:51,919
-Gold...
-Where's the gold?

378
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:59,439
-There's no gold, my Bey.
-What do you mean?

379
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:03,559
Konur raids the caravans and does all he wants.

380
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:09,039
What are my alps doing?
Tell me, what are you doing?

381
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:19,159
Look at me, Baysungur. Aykurt!

382
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:24,159
-You will find the gold and Konur.
-Yes, my Bey.

383
00:42:24,240 --> 00:42:25,839
Got it?

384
00:42:26,240 --> 00:42:30,199
Just like you handed him over

385
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:32,719
you will find him back.

386
00:42:33,560 --> 00:42:37,159
Yes, my Bey.

387
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:44,879
Back to work, everyone.
-My Bey.

388
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:49,279
No one will come after me.
-My Bey...

389
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:52,479
Cerkutay, you too.

390
00:43:05,320 --> 00:43:10,839
Alps, be careful.

391
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:13,959
Not only us, this fire

392
00:43:14,200 --> 00:43:18,079
can burn even a steel sword.

393
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:33,599
I know the taste of steel and blood very well.

394
00:43:34,160 --> 00:43:37,599
What are you going to do? Will you kill me?

395
00:43:37,760 --> 00:43:42,399
Tell me, how did you find me and who are you?

396
00:43:45,960 --> 00:43:48,599
I saved you, Konur.

397
00:43:48,880 --> 00:43:51,239
Ibrahim Bey.

398
00:43:52,320 --> 00:43:53,559
How did you find me?

399
00:43:53,840 --> 00:43:57,679
I heard that Osman Bey exiled you.

400
00:43:58,240 --> 00:44:04,519
Husrev is serving me, and you had a life to life.

401
00:44:05,160 --> 00:44:09,999
Tell me, why did you steal Osman Bey's gold?

402
00:44:10,080 --> 00:44:13,439
Western cities heard about it.

403
00:44:13,520 --> 00:44:18,279
-Tell me about the truth behind it.
-If courage is needed for the battle

404
00:44:18,360 --> 00:44:22,319
the gold is needed as well,
otherwise no one will stand behind you.

405
00:44:22,480 --> 00:44:25,599
You're saying battle.

406
00:44:25,880 --> 00:44:30,359
If you're choosing battle, stand behind me.

407
00:44:31,040 --> 00:44:33,959
Don't think that it would be inappropriate.

408
00:44:34,640 --> 00:44:38,599
I'll solve your problem with Osman Bey

409
00:44:38,880 --> 00:44:42,279
and settle the issue.

410
00:44:45,000 --> 00:44:46,319
You're saying battle.

411
00:44:48,480 --> 00:44:50,279
What is your target, Ibrahim Bey?

412
00:44:50,360 --> 00:44:53,559
Konur, hear me out.

413
00:44:53,760 --> 00:44:58,919
We have saved your life but are you questioning us?

414
00:44:59,680 --> 00:45:04,239
Konur's purpose in life is battle
of course he would question.

415
00:45:06,600 --> 00:45:11,199
My goal is the whole north of Byzantium,

416
00:45:11,680 --> 00:45:15,239
then Lznik, Bursa.

417
00:45:15,360 --> 00:45:18,919
It is Osman Bey's target. If
you're not from the same pack

418
00:45:19,240 --> 00:45:23,439
two wolves cannot hunt in the same mountain.

419
00:45:26,560 --> 00:45:30,399
It does not matter who carries the banner.

420
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:34,759
Think about it very well and make up your mind.

421
00:45:34,880 --> 00:45:37,319
We will make Orhan Bey's wedding,

422
00:45:38,440 --> 00:45:42,279
we will take Gonca bride and go back to Sinop.

423
00:45:42,680 --> 00:45:46,279
You have time until then.

424
00:45:49,280 --> 00:45:52,039
Alright Ibrahim Bey.

425
00:46:02,200 --> 00:46:06,119
May Allah protect you.

426
00:46:23,440 --> 00:46:27,119
Distribute this piece to my brothers.

427
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:32,719
About you...

428
00:46:33,760 --> 00:46:36,719
Turk.

429
00:46:38,800 --> 00:46:41,839
Bite me if you want to bite.

430
00:46:44,040 --> 00:46:46,399
Don't just show your teeth.

431
00:46:47,800 --> 00:46:52,559
Or I'll pull your teeth out.

432
00:46:57,440 --> 00:47:00,519
If I wanted to kill you

433
00:47:00,720 --> 00:47:03,759
I had already ripped your neck off with my teeth.

434
00:47:16,120 --> 00:47:19,119
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

435
00:47:20,720 --> 00:47:25,519
No, my Shahzade. Gonca
Hatun is nowhere to be found.

436
00:47:26,280 --> 00:47:29,159
Where are you, Gonca?

437
00:47:41,400 --> 00:47:43,239
Guice, where is Gonca?

438
00:47:43,480 --> 00:47:48,039
They put her in the caged tent when
she said she won't marry Candaroglu.

439
00:47:48,120 --> 00:47:52,039
-She will not take her to the wedding.
-How could Yakup Bey let this happen?

440
00:47:52,240 --> 00:47:54,759
Yakup Bey was very angry with Gonca Hatun.

441
00:47:54,920 --> 00:48:00,039
They will send Gonca Hatun to
Sinop after the wedding tomorrow.

442
00:48:06,160 --> 00:48:11,519
Tell her that Alaeddin will save
you no matter what happens.

443
00:48:14,520 --> 00:48:16,359
Come on.

444
00:48:21,360 --> 00:48:25,679
Yakup Bey, Yakup Bey.

445
00:48:29,880 --> 00:48:33,639
My Shahzade. Yakup Bey
and others are ready to set out.

446
00:48:33,720 --> 00:48:35,919
Come on.

447
00:48:39,440 --> 00:48:42,679
I have nowhere to go but you.

448
00:48:58,600 --> 00:49:02,279
I heard that you're all alone now.

449
00:49:02,360 --> 00:49:05,759
You lost your ma'am Olivia.

450
00:49:07,240 --> 00:49:10,599
And you know Gonca very well.

451
00:49:11,240 --> 00:49:16,199
Then tell me about Gonca and Alaeddin.

452
00:49:16,720 --> 00:49:20,639
Gonca Hatun and Alaeddin
Bey love each other very much.

453
00:49:20,760 --> 00:49:23,879
Everyone in the Frontiers knows this.

454
00:49:48,760 --> 00:49:52,199
Ertugrul Ghazi...

455
00:49:53,520 --> 00:49:56,039
My glorious father...

456
00:49:58,200 --> 00:50:03,879
We conquered many castles and
ended a crusade before it even started.

457
00:50:04,560 --> 00:50:08,439
We said... "Sure..

458
00:50:09,120 --> 00:50:14,279
...now Turks are becoming a union. The
one who sees gaza stands by our side."

459
00:50:14,880 --> 00:50:16,679
But...

460
00:50:17,920 --> 00:50:20,199
But those who we called our brothers...

461
00:50:20,800 --> 00:50:24,239
...those who we called our
brothers fell into carelessness.

462
00:50:24,400 --> 00:50:28,079
They set a trap on our way.

463
00:50:29,560 --> 00:50:34,919
Now., now we are alone like you.

464
00:50:35,800 --> 00:50:39,639
Now there are a few of us. But we will get crowded.

465
00:50:43,360 --> 00:50:48,399
Your grandson Orhan is getting married today.

466
00:50:48,720 --> 00:50:51,639
Then Alaeddin...

467
00:50:52,560 --> 00:50:55,479
Right... Right.

468
00:50:55,920 --> 00:50:58,759
We don't need...

469
00:50:58,840 --> 00:51:03,319
...we don't need anyone to support us.

470
00:51:08,800 --> 00:51:12,839
Our essence and our end are this land.

471
00:51:13,000 --> 00:51:18,439
But our struggle is still on
this land, isn't it, Osman Bey?

472
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:29,999
Our struggle is against the
unbelievers. Surely, we know.

473
00:51:30,600 --> 00:51:35,359
We know, but those who
stand behind us with a dagger...

474
00:51:35,720 --> 00:51:40,119
...and bow their heads to pray with us...

475
00:51:41,160 --> 00:51:43,519
That...

476
00:51:44,560 --> 00:51:47,759
That tightens our hearts.

477
00:51:50,760 --> 00:51:53,399
The Hadith says...

478
00:51:53,720 --> 00:51:58,919
..."Muslims are like the stones of a
building, each one supporting the other.'

479
00:51:59,040 --> 00:52:04,639
If the stones are separated,
the building collapses.

480
00:52:05,480 --> 00:52:10,439
That's why our Prophet (PBUH) said
"Don't hold grudges against each other...

481
00:52:10,600 --> 00:52:15,519
...don't envy each other, don't
turn your backs on each other...

482
00:52:15,680 --> 00:52:21,279
...O servants of Allah, be brothers/'.

483
00:52:21,440 --> 00:52:24,799
Why does he warn us?

484
00:52:25,000 --> 00:52:31,039
Because shaytaan tries to deceive
the one on the right path the most.

485
00:52:31,280 --> 00:52:36,399
Muslims desire as well.
Your desires can deceive you.

486
00:52:36,920 --> 00:52:39,959
It holds a grudge, it envies.

487
00:52:40,440 --> 00:52:46,079
Now, as your da'wah grows, as you get stronger...

488
00:52:46,440 --> 00:52:50,079
...those around you are tested...

489
00:52:50,400 --> 00:52:52,799
...with their ambitions and envy.

490
00:52:53,600 --> 00:52:58,039
And you are tested with pride and justice.

491
00:52:58,360 --> 00:53:02,839
Now, if you are fair like our Prophet...

492
00:53:03,040 --> 00:53:09,039
...if you show tolerance,
surely you will pass the test.

493
00:53:09,440 --> 00:53:13,239
Those brothers who see the justice in you...

494
00:53:13,320 --> 00:53:17,439
...will leave their grudge overcome their envy...

495
00:53:17,680 --> 00:53:23,679
...wake up from the sleep of carelessness
and pass their tests, if Allah permits.

496
00:53:25,920 --> 00:53:27,439
But...

497
00:53:29,560 --> 00:53:33,159
...what about those who cannot wake
up from the sleep of carelessness?

498
00:53:33,440 --> 00:53:36,559
If they persist in committing a sin...

499
00:53:36,640 --> 00:53:41,279
...they will sow seeds of disbelief
in their hearts, may Allah forbid.

500
00:53:42,200 --> 00:53:46,639
I know... I know.

501
00:53:48,440 --> 00:53:53,559
Your way is difficult. May my Allah help you.

502
00:53:53,640 --> 00:53:57,306
May He let you be victorious
against all your enemies

503
00:53:57,318 --> 00:54:00,519
the ones you can see
and cannot see, I hope.

504
00:54:06,960 --> 00:54:13,879
Aameen. Aameen, the Sultan of
words, Yunus Emre. Thank you.

505
00:54:36,680 --> 00:54:39,999
Gonca Hatun... I heard such things that...

506
00:54:40,080 --> 00:54:42,959
...it was Kanyumaz who
informed Imren about Osman Bey.

507
00:54:43,160 --> 00:54:45,279
What are you saying, Guice?

508
00:54:45,360 --> 00:54:48,799
What did my father say to this?
-He didn't say anything!

509
00:54:49,120 --> 00:54:53,959
He forgave him by saying it only hurt Osman.

510
00:54:54,200 --> 00:54:57,759
He united with Candaroglu to take Bursa and Iznik.

511
00:54:57,880 --> 00:55:00,759
They made an alliance with Mekece Lord.

512
00:55:01,320 --> 00:55:04,879
They are saying that they can even
walk over Osman Bey for this path.

513
00:55:04,880 --> 00:55:08,279
They are saying that they will
kill whoever stands in their way.

514
00:55:08,280 --> 00:55:10,839
He was defeated by Osman Bey when he left...

515
00:55:11,160 --> 00:55:14,079
...he is blinded by his ambition.

516
00:55:16,040 --> 00:55:20,039
No... My father is going to
make a big mistake, Guice.

517
00:55:20,240 --> 00:55:24,839
-What are you going to do, my Hatun?
-There is only one thing I can do now.

518
00:55:24,920 --> 00:55:27,519
You will bring me a piece of paper and a pen.

519
00:55:27,760 --> 00:55:32,359
I will send a letter to Alaeddin Bey. Go.

520
00:55:48,320 --> 00:55:54,439
Alaeddin Bey gave it to me. He
said he would not leave you here.

521
00:56:01,440 --> 00:56:05,159
I am loyal to my oath, Scholar.

522
00:56:05,760 --> 00:56:09,959
No matter what, I won't go back.

523
00:56:18,400 --> 00:56:21,239
Thank you, thank you.
Thank you.

524
00:56:21,760 --> 00:56:23,839
Thank you, I appreciate it.

525
00:56:24,800 --> 00:56:27,559
-Thanks
-May your family grow!

526
00:56:30,280 --> 00:56:33,159
Oh Praise be!

527
00:56:42,280 --> 00:56:46,239
Thank you Gunduz Bey.

528
00:57:02,160 --> 00:57:06,079
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

529
00:57:26,120 --> 00:57:29,679
It fell right on target, brother.

530
00:58:12,160 --> 00:58:16,159
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

531
00:58:48,400 --> 00:58:51,199
Prase be! Praise be!

532
00:58:51,320 --> 00:58:55,599
May their family be blessed.

533
00:58:56,840 --> 00:59:00,359
Praise be! Praise be!

534
00:59:00,720 --> 00:59:04,399
Sisters, give me the water.

535
00:59:25,640 --> 00:59:29,199
May it be blessed! -Aameen!

536
00:59:29,280 --> 00:59:31,519
Aameen!

537
00:59:32,840 --> 00:59:36,279
Alps! Start building the tent!

538
00:59:36,400 --> 00:59:38,759
It'll be ready by evening.

539
00:59:38,960 --> 00:59:43,719
May my Allah let you see the
tent of your children, I hope.

540
00:59:43,960 --> 00:59:46,559
Aameen.

541
00:59:48,560 --> 00:59:53,199
-May you live in peace.
-Aameen.

542
00:59:55,680 --> 01:00:00,399
You all know. For the future of our nation,

543
01:00:01,000 --> 01:00:05,719
...Elcim Hatun and I are getting
married. For the same cause.

544
01:00:06,360 --> 01:00:11,679
-And we will raise our children with Allah's will.
-If Allah permits.

545
01:00:34,560 --> 01:00:37,479
Malhun, are you alright?

546
01:00:37,600 --> 01:00:40,879
I have a killing ache here.
And it's getting stronger.

547
01:00:41,000 --> 01:00:44,199
-Oh no. Are you serious?
-Look.

548
01:00:44,240 --> 01:00:46,999
It hurts too much.

549
01:00:49,200 --> 01:00:51,639
We should make Aladdin check this.

550
01:00:51,880 --> 01:00:54,719
-Alright. Alright.
-Let's go.

551
01:01:02,000 --> 01:01:06,039
-Welcome, my Bey!
-Osman Bey, welcome!

552
01:01:15,840 --> 01:01:21,359
Is there a problem, Osman Bey? Seeing
the alps coming back early, we got worried.

553
01:01:22,000 --> 01:01:26,839
I went to tell my father Ertugrul Ghazi
about the wedding of his grandson.

554
01:01:30,720 --> 01:01:33,759
But it's not about the wedding.

555
01:01:34,160 --> 01:01:38,359
-Konur?
-Yes, Konur.

556
01:01:39,560 --> 01:01:44,119
He'll get both himself and us ruined.

557
01:01:47,920 --> 01:01:52,159
He's attempting recruit men
for himself with Olcaytu's gold.

558
01:01:57,400 --> 01:02:00,479
-Whatever.
-My Bey.

559
01:02:00,880 --> 01:02:04,839
-I hope the wedding won't be delayed.
-No, don't worry.

560
01:02:05,160 --> 01:02:08,239
I dispersed the looters around him.

561
01:02:08,720 --> 01:02:11,879
He can't regain his strength easily.

562
01:02:13,840 --> 01:02:18,679
Everybody for himself, Osman Bey.
I hope he'll make up for his mistake.

563
01:02:19,080 --> 01:02:23,799
I hope so, I hope so.

564
01:02:31,480 --> 01:02:36,359
I've been unfair to you.
What we have gone through...

565
01:02:39,040 --> 01:02:42,319
I blamed you without listening.

566
01:02:43,000 --> 01:02:45,479
I drew a dagger against you.

567
01:02:46,920 --> 01:02:49,039
I want to apologize.

568
01:02:49,520 --> 01:02:53,679
Yes. We have gone through a lot.

569
01:02:55,200 --> 01:02:59,159
But, it wasn't our fault.

570
01:02:59,240 --> 01:03:03,599
As I get to know you better,
my conscience chokes me.

571
01:03:04,200 --> 01:03:07,279
Release your conscience from this suffering.

572
01:03:07,920 --> 01:03:12,079
-You couldn't have known.
-I'm sorry.

573
01:03:13,240 --> 01:03:16,479
For everything.

574
01:03:17,520 --> 01:03:21,199
Don't be. For the future of thousands of people,

575
01:03:21,480 --> 01:03:24,359
...you had to do it.

576
01:03:25,760 --> 01:03:28,319
We had to.

577
01:03:31,040 --> 01:03:35,399
I'm waiting for a ship. When it
arrives, I'll go to Constantinople.

578
01:03:35,520 --> 01:03:39,919
Otherwise, I would never
be here on your wedding day.

579
01:03:43,280 --> 01:03:46,199
It seems you made up your mind.

580
01:03:55,800 --> 01:03:58,519
May you have a safe journey.

581
01:04:00,880 --> 01:04:03,439
Give me your blessings
in this world and the doomsday.

582
01:04:04,280 --> 01:04:06,879
I do.

583
01:04:24,800 --> 01:04:27,999
Welcome to our wedding.

584
01:04:28,200 --> 01:04:31,279
Welcome!

585
01:04:53,040 --> 01:04:58,359
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

586
01:04:59,280 --> 01:05:03,959
-Welcome, Melike Hatun.
-Welcome.

587
01:05:04,160 --> 01:05:06,479
Is this your first time in the frontiers?

588
01:05:06,680 --> 01:05:10,439
Thank you. Yes. It's my first.

589
01:05:10,680 --> 01:05:15,679
We came to take the new bride
Gonca and also for the wedding.

590
01:05:26,280 --> 01:05:29,559
Osman Bey, it's an honor...

591
01:05:29,720 --> 01:05:35,079
...for me to meet a valiant Turkish Bey like you.

592
01:05:36,400 --> 01:05:40,199
I hope your wedding will bring the good.

593
01:05:40,640 --> 01:05:45,119
-I hope so, I hope so.
-I hope so.

594
01:05:46,440 --> 01:05:49,599
I was expecting to find you..

595
01:05:49,840 --> 01:05:52,959
...in the palace in Yenisehir.

596
01:05:53,360 --> 01:05:57,839
But you said you'd have the wedding in the tribe.

597
01:05:57,920 --> 01:06:02,479
Well... I wanted your feet...

598
01:06:02,560 --> 01:06:07,119
...to touch the ground, Ibrahim Bey.

599
01:06:13,880 --> 01:06:17,079
Thanks for welcoming, Osman Bey.

600
01:06:17,720 --> 01:06:22,559
But the situation doesn't seem well to me.

601
01:06:25,000 --> 01:06:29,639
You used the frontier market to repel Crusaders.

602
01:06:33,040 --> 01:06:35,519
If you had failed

603
01:06:35,880 --> 01:06:37,919
...the price would have been very heavy.

604
01:06:38,000 --> 01:06:41,679
I carry the rock with my own hands only.

605
01:06:41,880 --> 01:06:44,159
I do that...

606
01:06:44,640 --> 01:06:49,359
...so nobody will doubt
whether I can shoulder it or not.

607
01:06:54,680 --> 01:06:57,599
Right, Ibrahim Bey?

608
01:06:58,760 --> 01:07:00,599
Ha?

609
01:07:02,400 --> 01:07:05,879
While Crusaders were preparing to attack us,

610
01:07:07,160 --> 01:07:10,159
...where were you?

611
01:07:12,280 --> 01:07:16,879
Tell me. Where were you?

612
01:07:21,280 --> 01:07:26,559
If we hadn't finished Crusade before
it even started, then all the Turks...

613
01:07:27,040 --> 01:07:30,239
..would have suffered from it.

614
01:07:35,600 --> 01:07:38,319
Whatever.

615
01:07:38,680 --> 01:07:41,719
I don't expect gratitude from anyone.

616
01:07:42,880 --> 01:07:49,279
But if someone attempts to
resist while we fight Crusaders,

617
01:07:49,600 --> 01:07:52,599
...we will never let that happen!

618
01:07:53,320 --> 01:07:55,839
Everyone should know that.

619
01:07:59,120 --> 01:08:02,799
Who is even resisting you?

620
01:08:03,280 --> 01:08:06,999
The enemy stopped because we stopped them together.

621
01:08:07,400 --> 01:08:09,639
Didn't you have...

622
01:08:09,960 --> 01:08:14,639
...the support of Germiyan in your every victory?

623
01:08:14,920 --> 01:08:19,158
Didn't my son Mehmed Bey stand behind you?

624
01:08:19,359 --> 01:08:24,118
He shouldn't have stood beside me, not behind me.

625
01:08:25,040 --> 01:08:27,679
Yakup Bey.

626
01:08:34,120 --> 01:08:39,959
Now we're standing beside you, Osman Bey.

627
01:08:41,359 --> 01:08:44,959
We're in the wedding of your son Orhan Bey.

628
01:08:46,479 --> 01:08:50,398
We shouldn't dwell on the matter on this happy day.

629
01:08:50,640 --> 01:08:57,919
If Allah permits, we will have
wedding and fights together.

630
01:09:03,479 --> 01:09:05,999
Alright then.

631
01:09:06,520 --> 01:09:11,639
So be it. It's better than you standing against me.

632
01:09:14,000 --> 01:09:17,999
We'll have many more happy
days. Let me tell you my target then.

633
01:09:18,120 --> 01:09:22,318
Bursa and Iznik!

634
01:09:33,000 --> 01:09:38,679
Oh, Osman Bey. Oh... Be patient.

635
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:42,999
Your alps, horses and you should rest first.

636
01:09:43,160 --> 01:09:48,238
No. Alps fall on the ground and horses die.

637
01:09:48,279 --> 01:09:50,879
And a bey leaves his chair to his son.

638
01:09:51,640 --> 01:09:56,439
But we never rest.

639
01:10:04,520 --> 01:10:06,799
As they say...

640
01:10:07,280 --> 01:10:10,879
Our dreams are longer than our lives.

641
01:10:11,240 --> 01:10:14,359
Yes.

642
01:10:15,400 --> 01:10:21,359
Well, Beys... Your dream is our dream.

643
01:10:21,440 --> 01:10:24,399
It's alright. But...

644
01:10:25,000 --> 01:10:31,599
Both Germiyan and Candar
have trade with Bursa and Iznik.

645
01:10:31,920 --> 01:10:33,679
This move of yours...

646
01:10:33,800 --> 01:10:36,679
...won't be beneficial to us.

647
01:10:39,680 --> 01:10:43,159
We should think thoroughly then.

648
01:10:43,880 --> 01:10:46,639
Right, Ibrahim Bey?

649
01:10:48,920 --> 01:10:52,519
Should we be Beys who care about their people...

650
01:10:52,920 --> 01:10:59,399
...or be merchants to deal with trade?

651
01:11:01,280 --> 01:11:05,799
Neither trade nor beylic, Osman Bey!

652
01:11:06,120 --> 01:11:08,719
As you said

653
01:11:09,040 --> 01:11:13,759
...we should give our service to our people.

654
01:11:15,080 --> 01:11:19,879
That's why Yakup Bey and I are
making our children get married.

655
01:11:29,000 --> 01:11:32,719
For more powerful armies.

656
01:11:36,160 --> 01:11:40,199
Alright then. Let's get to the tent...

657
01:11:40,560 --> 01:11:42,999
..and discuss it.

658
01:11:43,400 --> 01:11:48,319
Let us see who will be happy..

659
01:11:49,720 --> 01:11:53,559
..about the conquest of Bursa and Iznik..

660
01:11:54,200 --> 01:11:57,199
..and who will be upset.

661
01:11:58,040 --> 01:12:00,279
Let us go.

662
01:12:12,200 --> 01:12:18,159
Melike Hatun. Let us go to the arbour.

663
01:12:30,240 --> 01:12:37,359
Alaeddin, what is it, brother? You seem upset.

664
01:12:40,360 --> 01:12:44,639
They locked Gonca in the caged tent.

665
01:13:01,160 --> 01:13:02,794
Are there any news from Konur?

666
01:13:02,806 --> 01:13:04,399
I've heard from Osman's men.

667
01:13:04,760 --> 01:13:07,639
-He escaped.
-Good.

668
01:13:07,760 --> 01:13:10,999
Then, he will come here.

669
01:13:16,640 --> 01:13:20,319
Have you lost your mind, Boran? Shut it!

670
01:13:20,520 --> 01:13:25,039
I haven't lost it, but you will.

671
01:13:25,960 --> 01:13:28,719
Do not worry.

672
01:13:29,640 --> 01:13:33,199
My Osman Bey will show you.

673
01:13:33,960 --> 01:13:36,439
Shut him up!

674
01:13:51,040 --> 01:13:56,119
I will not let you live this time, Boran.
Konur is the reason why you are alive.

675
01:13:56,440 --> 01:14:00,279
You will not let me you say? That will be right.

676
01:14:00,360 --> 01:14:04,599
Do not hold back! Come!

677
01:14:10,120 --> 01:14:16,359
Will you do it by yourself?

678
01:14:16,800 --> 01:14:19,999
So you will do it by yourself.

679
01:14:28,440 --> 01:14:33,279
Come, Konur Bey. This will be settled today.

680
01:14:33,400 --> 01:14:35,639
Come.

681
01:14:35,720 --> 01:14:40,159
We thought you would arrange
your wedding at the palace.

682
01:14:40,400 --> 01:14:43,439
However, you arranged it at the tribe.

683
01:14:44,720 --> 01:14:49,759
One should not forget where
they came from, Melike Hatun.

684
01:14:49,840 --> 01:14:53,679
As both the tribe and the palace is ours.

685
01:14:53,760 --> 01:14:57,199
They are.

686
01:14:58,240 --> 01:15:02,799
We will arrange our son Ahmed and our
daughter Gonca's wedding at the palace.

687
01:15:02,920 --> 01:15:07,799
-You must've heard about it, Bala Hatun.
-Yes, we've heard it.

688
01:15:08,600 --> 01:15:11,639
May everything come out good in the end.

689
01:15:13,360 --> 01:15:18,759
We were hoping to see Saadet
Hatun. Why didn't she come?

690
01:15:19,280 --> 01:15:21,639
Saadet brought the dowery to Sinop.

691
01:15:21,720 --> 01:15:26,319
As you know, there are a lot of work
to be done, wedding is getting closer.

692
01:15:26,360 --> 01:15:30,479
You can see Saadet at Sinop.

693
01:15:30,920 --> 01:15:35,359
Let us see when the time comes, Melike Hatun.

694
01:15:35,480 --> 01:15:39,679
Those times are very close, Malhun Hatun.

695
01:15:40,000 --> 01:15:43,399
You are uniting two Kayis..

696
01:15:43,560 --> 01:15:48,439
..and we are uniting two tribes.

697
01:15:49,720 --> 01:15:55,319
No one will have the strength
to seperate this unity anymore.

698
01:15:59,160 --> 01:16:02,759
Where is our girl Gonca, Melike Hatun?

699
01:16:02,920 --> 01:16:06,039
You are talking about wedding and all.

700
01:16:06,120 --> 01:16:08,799
However, your bride is not here.

701
01:16:10,600 --> 01:16:14,159
Does she not want this marriage?

702
01:16:15,040 --> 01:16:21,319
My daughter Gonca is a little ill. She
wouldn't leave me alone otherwise.

703
01:16:25,640 --> 01:16:29,279
Orhan Bey is getting married.

704
01:16:29,480 --> 01:16:34,479
It is your son's turn, Bala Hatun.

705
01:16:36,920 --> 01:16:40,639
What was his name?

706
01:16:41,680 --> 01:16:45,279
Alaeddin Ali.

707
01:16:45,800 --> 01:16:48,719
These things are bound to fate, Melike Hatun.

708
01:16:49,000 --> 01:16:53,759
My Alaeddin might get married before we know it.

709
01:16:53,840 --> 01:16:56,199
-If Allah permits, Bala.
-If Allah permits.

710
01:16:56,480 --> 01:16:59,399
If Allah permits

711
01:17:04,040 --> 01:17:09,199
I do not understand, brother. How
can a father put his daughter in a cell?

712
01:17:09,280 --> 01:17:13,919
They know Gonca won't stand
still. However, do not worry, brother.

713
01:17:14,640 --> 01:17:20,599
-We will not leave Gonca there.
-Of course we will not.

714
01:17:21,400 --> 01:17:26,279
She feels alone now as she got
backstabbed by her most trusted.

715
01:17:27,640 --> 01:17:30,519
I should be with her now.

716
01:17:30,800 --> 01:17:34,239
You will be.

717
01:17:34,320 --> 01:17:37,419
A little patience, you will be.

718
01:17:37,431 --> 01:17:40,639
If Allah permits, brother.

719
01:17:45,720 --> 01:17:50,159
Mehmed. Heartless Mehmed.

720
01:17:51,920 --> 01:17:55,239
You stood against your
sister instead of being with her.

721
01:17:55,360 --> 01:17:58,919
Alaeddin, they must not
know we know where Gonca is.

722
01:17:59,040 --> 01:18:01,559
Stay calm, brother.

723
01:18:02,040 --> 01:18:05,679
You don't leave the training
grounds even at the wedding day.

724
01:18:05,680 --> 01:18:08,399
These Kayis are just like that, Ahmed Bey.

725
01:18:09,880 --> 01:18:13,519
What is it, Alaeddin Bey? You seem quite angry?

726
01:18:13,640 --> 01:18:17,839
No. That is just what you think, Mehmed Bey.

727
01:18:18,640 --> 01:18:23,759
We couldn't meet properly at marketplace,
Alaeddin Bey, I've heard about your name.

728
01:18:24,360 --> 01:18:29,159
You are a student of knowledge. You went to school.

729
01:18:29,600 --> 01:18:35,119
So, what are you doing at the training grounds?

730
01:18:36,200 --> 01:18:39,839
However, we never heard about your name, Ahmed Bey.

731
01:18:42,240 --> 01:18:45,399
-What is your virtue?
-Didn't you hear it?

732
01:18:45,480 --> 01:18:50,439
He is engaged to Gonca. Who
else would be better for her.

733
01:18:55,280 --> 01:19:00,599
By the way, his sword is sharp..

734
01:19:01,200 --> 01:19:03,359
..and his wrist in unmatched.

735
01:19:07,960 --> 01:19:10,479
Yes.

736
01:19:10,560 --> 01:19:15,919
You work with pencils I work with swords.

737
01:19:16,800 --> 01:19:20,799
Is that so, Ahmed Bey?

738
01:19:21,600 --> 01:19:23,799
You didn't hear about him enough.

739
01:19:24,800 --> 01:19:29,519
Alaeddin does not only work
with pencils. He is skilled at arms..

740
01:19:29,600 --> 01:19:32,279
..as much as he is skilled with pencils.

741
01:19:32,360 --> 01:19:37,039
If you want to see for
yourself, here is the valiant.

742
01:19:37,400 --> 01:19:41,679
-And here is the field.
-Alright then.

743
01:19:42,320 --> 01:19:45,799
Let us see your skills, Alaeddin Bey.

744
01:19:47,800 --> 01:19:49,399
Come on, brother.

745
01:19:59,040 --> 01:20:02,039
You will have wedding soon as well.

746
01:20:02,120 --> 01:20:06,879
Soon, if Allah permits. We will go to Sinop..

747
01:20:07,080 --> 01:20:11,119
..and arrange the wedding at Ibrahim Bey's land.

748
01:20:12,440 --> 01:20:17,439
Let us invite you while we are here, Gunduz Bey.

749
01:20:17,600 --> 01:20:21,519
Of course, we shall come.

750
01:20:22,200 --> 01:20:24,919
Of course we will come.

751
01:20:25,440 --> 01:20:28,039
We will not leave you alone..

752
01:20:28,880 --> 01:20:31,959
..in this glorious day.

753
01:20:37,640 --> 01:20:40,119
However..

754
01:20:40,640 --> 01:20:46,559
..we want you at the field of war with us.

755
01:20:47,480 --> 01:20:51,519
If you say you don't want to join...

756
01:20:51,600 --> 01:20:55,359
...so be it.

757
01:20:57,960 --> 01:21:00,879
However, know this.

758
01:21:01,120 --> 01:21:06,839
We will conquer Bursa and Iznik.

759
01:21:09,480 --> 01:21:13,479
Do not stand against us.

760
01:21:13,720 --> 01:21:16,319
Do not even think about it.

761
01:21:18,560 --> 01:21:21,279
Everyone..

762
01:21:22,520 --> 01:21:26,199
..everyone will know their hunting grounds.

763
01:21:30,200 --> 01:21:33,399
Your honesty has...

764
01:21:33,480 --> 01:21:38,199
...made me really happy, Osman Bey.

765
01:21:42,800 --> 01:21:47,399
Now you're talking about a hunting ground...

766
01:21:47,600 --> 01:21:51,999
What about the prey? Say this as well.

767
01:21:52,920 --> 01:21:57,919
Bursa and Iznik are not preys for us.

768
01:21:58,560 --> 01:22:03,159
Those are the goats that have strayed...

769
01:22:03,240 --> 01:22:05,839
..from our flock to yours.

770
01:22:08,360 --> 01:22:11,759
We milk them.

771
01:22:11,880 --> 01:22:16,239
We trade with them.

772
01:22:16,400 --> 01:22:20,479
We profit from them.

773
01:22:20,640 --> 01:22:23,959
The prey is not determined by shepherds...

774
01:22:24,600 --> 01:22:28,599
...only by wolves.

775
01:22:33,520 --> 01:22:37,199
We call Bursa and Iznik...

776
01:22:37,320 --> 01:22:41,959
...our prey. How will this happen?

777
01:22:44,760 --> 01:22:48,479
If we say we'll set out tomorrow..

778
01:22:50,840 --> 01:22:54,679
...will you stand against us?

779
01:22:54,760 --> 01:22:59,639
If necessary yes, Osman Bey.

780
01:23:00,800 --> 01:23:04,999
You got used to making decisions alone...

781
01:23:05,080 --> 01:23:09,279
...just because we withdrew to Kutahya once.

782
01:23:09,560 --> 01:23:15,039
From now on, moves will
be made together as a unity.

783
01:23:15,840 --> 01:23:21,319
Good then. We will either go there together...

784
01:23:22,320 --> 01:23:26,439
...or I will walk over you, know that!

785
01:23:30,760 --> 01:23:37,119
Because your intention is not trading.

786
01:23:38,480 --> 01:23:41,519
Why do you say that, Osman Bey?

787
01:23:41,520 --> 01:23:44,431
Tell us then, what
is our intention?

788
01:23:44,443 --> 01:23:47,519
Your intention is
to take these cities.

789
01:23:48,200 --> 01:23:55,359
Your intention is to block our
path, to strike a blow against us.

790
01:23:56,840 --> 01:24:01,079
Ever since my father took Sogut
our arrow has always been...

791
01:24:01,160 --> 01:24:05,479
...aimed at Bursa and Iznik. Know this.

792
01:24:05,560 --> 01:24:08,999
We will take those cities.

793
01:24:12,680 --> 01:24:16,319
Either with you or without you.

794
01:24:16,520 --> 01:24:18,679
Make your decision.

795
01:24:27,720 --> 01:24:31,039
While no one says a certain thing...

796
01:24:31,120 --> 01:24:33,999
...you speak like an arrow, Osman Bey.

797
01:24:34,080 --> 01:24:37,759
We always shoot our arrows at the infidels.

798
01:24:38,920 --> 01:24:41,159
If it finds you...

799
01:24:44,720 --> 01:24:49,159
...then you're in the wrong place.

800
01:24:54,240 --> 01:24:58,639
This is not a matter to be
discussed between two weddings.

801
01:24:59,520 --> 01:25:03,799
Let your wedding and our wedding happen...

802
01:25:04,200 --> 01:25:08,719
...and when the time comes, we'll determine...

803
01:25:09,320 --> 01:25:12,439
...our gaza and our trade.

804
01:25:12,600 --> 01:25:16,759
If you want to speak with me...

805
01:25:17,240 --> 01:25:20,799
...you'll find me only on the battlefield.

806
01:25:27,280 --> 01:25:31,239
Safely.

807
01:25:47,680 --> 01:25:53,599
Osman still magnifies himself even in
his tribe which looks like a sheepfold.

808
01:25:53,720 --> 01:25:56,759
We need to open his eyes, Yakup Bey.

809
01:25:57,000 --> 01:26:00,639
We will. We will.

810
01:26:00,720 --> 01:26:04,279
He will know his place and his limits.

811
01:26:04,800 --> 01:26:08,119
Tugay. Inform Olcay.

812
01:26:08,400 --> 01:26:12,999
It's time. Now our swords will speak.

813
01:26:13,080 --> 01:26:17,239
I explored the marketplace, my
Bey. The storekeepers stay at the inn.

814
01:26:17,360 --> 01:26:22,279
When we kill storekeepers and burn their goods...

815
01:26:22,560 --> 01:26:26,519
...Osman's trade will be over, right, Yakup Bey?

816
01:26:26,960 --> 01:26:29,039
Yes. Right.

817
01:26:29,240 --> 01:26:32,959
I think we should do it at night,
during the wedding ceremony, my Bey.

818
01:26:32,960 --> 01:26:37,639
If we burn and destroy everything with a
sudden night raid, we'll get what we want.

819
01:26:38,880 --> 01:26:42,239
You thought well Tugay.

820
01:26:42,840 --> 01:26:46,519
And this will be useful for my co-in-law.

821
01:26:47,880 --> 01:26:51,559
Making brothers enemies will let
us gain something today, my Bey.

822
01:26:51,640 --> 01:26:54,199
What if it causes something bad the other day?

823
01:26:55,200 --> 01:26:57,959
Our aim is to make Osman fall.

824
01:26:58,320 --> 01:27:03,519
If he does not fall, he will
cause many other bad things.

825
01:27:13,640 --> 01:27:20,439
Osman... Your end has come
Osman. Your end has come.

826
01:27:21,040 --> 01:27:24,479
You are a guest at the frontiers. Go first.

827
01:27:24,760 --> 01:27:29,079
Right... I am a guest. I will
take my fiancee and leave.

828
01:27:33,560 --> 01:27:36,719
Aren't you too old now? Don't
you have someone you love?

829
01:27:44,240 --> 01:27:50,399
I do. I do, but... Valiants keep their love secret.

830
01:27:50,480 --> 01:27:55,199
Because it is valuable. We hide it in our hearts.

831
01:27:55,280 --> 01:27:58,759
But apparently, your heart is empty.

832
01:28:01,160 --> 01:28:06,119
Love is the toy of children!

833
01:28:17,720 --> 01:28:21,039
I am doing my duty for my
Beylic! One can promise for once...

834
01:28:21,040 --> 01:28:23,799
...and it is kept until the doomsday.
The word is our honour!

835
01:28:30,320 --> 01:28:35,119
Praise be to my brother.

836
01:28:53,800 --> 01:28:57,919
A word I will keep until I die.

837
01:29:00,880 --> 01:29:02,799
Come at me.

838
01:29:22,880 --> 01:29:27,079
Come at me, Ahmet Bey. Don't sit there.

839
01:29:33,040 --> 01:29:38,199
Praise be, Alaeddin Bey. Praise be.

840
01:29:38,840 --> 01:29:43,279
I don't count this one. In our
wedding with Gonca Hatun

841
01:29:43,640 --> 01:29:46,959
-I'd like to do it one more time.
-What are you saying?

842
01:29:47,040 --> 01:29:49,719
You will do it, Ahmed Bey.

843
01:29:50,000 --> 01:29:55,199
After all, the beaten wrestler
is never satisfied with wrestling

844
01:29:55,800 --> 01:30:00,279
But first, don't leave your sword on the ground.

845
01:30:03,440 --> 01:30:07,639
Come on, brother.

846
01:30:13,600 --> 01:30:17,239
Come on, Ahmed.

847
01:30:22,400 --> 01:30:25,519
I know your wound, Alaeddin.

848
01:30:25,600 --> 01:30:29,839
Your wound, will be my lover.

849
01:30:34,240 --> 01:30:38,039
You are the one who lost this fight.

850
01:30:43,000 --> 01:30:45,639
Alaeddin Bey.

851
01:30:47,600 --> 01:30:53,879
-Guice? What happened?
-Gonca Hatun sent this to you.

852
01:30:55,920 --> 01:30:58,319
Is Gonca all right?

853
01:30:59,320 --> 01:31:05,279
I've come secretly I need to leave.

854
01:31:15,440 --> 01:31:19,119
Gonca.

855
01:31:30,760 --> 01:31:33,119
Mother.

856
01:31:46,200 --> 01:31:50,719
-Something's going on.
-Turgut.

857
01:31:51,680 --> 01:31:56,919
Watch Alaeddin, let me know if he leaves the tribe.

858
01:32:05,160 --> 01:32:09,639
-Gonca will go to Sinop tomorrow.
-Let's go to my father.

859
01:32:11,360 --> 01:32:14,479
-Come on, son.
-Come on.

860
01:32:25,640 --> 01:32:28,919
Husrev.

861
01:32:31,560 --> 01:32:33,879
Husrev.

862
01:32:41,640 --> 01:32:46,999
Welcome, Konur. I've been waiting for you.

863
01:32:47,080 --> 01:32:49,599
You will pay for your treason.

864
01:32:49,800 --> 01:32:54,279
I chose my path, I did not betray.

865
01:32:58,360 --> 01:33:00,479
Are you going to walk with them?

866
01:33:01,280 --> 01:33:06,439
The path is right, Boran.
I took the marauders, but

867
01:33:06,520 --> 01:33:09,399
my path is the same as Osman Bey.

868
01:33:09,480 --> 01:33:14,519
It's been long since you left that path, Konur.

869
01:33:16,320 --> 01:33:21,879
-Now you will pay for it all.
-You can take my life, Boran.

870
01:33:22,840 --> 01:33:29,479
Listen to me carefully. Osman
Bey is in trouble. Help me.

871
01:33:29,920 --> 01:33:34,759
-What trouble? What are you saying?
-Candaroglu Ibrahim Bey.

872
01:33:35,000 --> 01:33:38,359
He saved me from Osman Bey
and he wanted to get me behind him.

873
01:33:38,440 --> 01:33:42,479
Even Husrev is his man. They're up to something.

874
01:33:43,160 --> 01:33:46,879
What are they after?

875
01:33:48,120 --> 01:33:52,639
-What did you get into, Konur?
-We will find out, Boran.

876
01:33:52,720 --> 01:33:56,079
He says he's here for Orhan
Bey's wedding, but I don't believe it.

877
01:33:56,160 --> 01:33:59,399
They will plot against Osman Bey.

878
01:34:00,640 --> 01:34:03,719
They will form an alliance with Yakup Bey.

879
01:34:04,120 --> 01:34:08,839
They will unite and stab Osman Bey from his back.

880
01:34:09,440 --> 01:34:13,999
There's only one way to find
out. We will be one of them.

881
01:34:17,280 --> 01:34:22,679
You've seen what Gonca wrote. She says she
will send her to Sinop if we don't save her.

882
01:34:23,160 --> 01:34:26,959
They are plotting against you. She
says they are plotting against you

883
01:34:27,040 --> 01:34:30,839
and they will stop you for Bursa and Iznik.

884
01:34:31,600 --> 01:34:36,279
-What are we going to do, Osman Bey?
-Their intention is to

885
01:34:36,520 --> 01:34:39,519
stop the conquest of Bursa and Iznik.

886
01:34:40,000 --> 01:34:46,519
They will use their trade as an
excuse. They will try to eliminate us.

887
01:34:47,080 --> 01:34:52,039
Even the purpose of their wedding is to hurt us.

888
01:34:52,240 --> 01:34:56,279
My Bey, father, Osman Bey.
Tell me whatever you want,

889
01:34:56,600 --> 01:34:59,879
but for Allah's sake, don't say stop.

890
01:35:01,400 --> 01:35:03,599
Son.

891
01:35:04,680 --> 01:35:07,519
Their desires...

892
01:35:08,320 --> 01:35:11,159
...lead their intentions.

893
01:35:13,320 --> 01:35:19,639
So, you will go and take Gonca.

894
01:35:23,520 --> 01:35:27,959
This will be the greatest strike against them.

895
01:35:28,120 --> 01:35:31,519
Thank you, my Bey.

896
01:35:34,280 --> 01:35:39,439
That's it. They crossed the
line, we will teach them a lesson.

897
01:35:42,240 --> 01:35:47,959
Son. Go and bring my daughter-in-law.

898
01:35:50,880 --> 01:35:53,319
-Now, my Bey?
-You're in such a hurry.

899
01:35:53,680 --> 01:35:57,359
Just wait. Just wait.

900
01:35:57,840 --> 01:36:01,599
During the wedding,

901
01:36:02,880 --> 01:36:07,879
while everyone is in the
wedding, you will kidnap Gonca.

902
01:36:08,240 --> 01:36:13,799
-Yes, my Bey. I will kidnap Gonca tonight.
-My brother.

903
01:36:14,120 --> 01:36:20,999
-May it be mubarak.
-May it be mubarak, brother.

904
01:36:25,560 --> 01:36:28,439
Let's get out.

905
01:36:29,920 --> 01:36:32,759
-Son.
-Mother.

906
01:36:34,000 --> 01:36:38,039
Take a look at your Malhun mother.
Her arm has been aching since morning.

907
01:36:38,320 --> 01:36:40,959
-Mother, what happened?
-It's nothing important, son.

908
01:36:41,080 --> 01:36:44,599
I feel a pain all of a sudden
but then it goes away.

909
01:36:44,680 --> 01:36:46,719
No, it's not right.

910
01:36:47,080 --> 01:36:51,199
We need to take a look. You know
that we should not ignore these things.

911
01:36:51,200 --> 01:36:55,079
Let's have a look, son.

912
01:36:57,760 --> 01:37:03,359
Look at the bride, henna in her hand

913
01:37:03,560 --> 01:37:09,439
look at the bride, henna in her hand

914
01:37:09,640 --> 01:37:21,119
don't say anything to her,
or she'll sulk and go away

915
01:37:21,200 --> 01:37:27,119
congratulations for your henna,
may your tent be gorgeous,

916
01:37:27,360 --> 01:37:33,519
congratulations for your henna
may your tent be gorgeous.

917
01:37:33,600 --> 01:37:41,959
Look at the bride, henna in
her hand, look at the bride,

918
01:37:42,040 --> 01:37:47,719
henna in her hand, don't say anything
to her, or she'll sulk and go away,

919
01:37:48,000 --> 01:37:53,519
or she'll sulk away and
go, don't say anything to her

920
01:37:53,760 --> 01:37:57,079
or she'll sulk and go away.

921
01:38:03,800 --> 01:38:07,079
May it be mubarak, daughter.

922
01:38:08,560 --> 01:38:14,519
May Allah bless you, daughter.

923
01:38:27,360 --> 01:38:33,479
The way to exist in these blessed lands

924
01:38:33,560 --> 01:38:37,159
is to be united, Beys.

925
01:38:37,560 --> 01:38:43,479
And unity is established
behind the one who is stronger

926
01:38:44,040 --> 01:38:49,159
and the one who will not put people
in a difficult situation for his whims.

927
01:38:49,240 --> 01:38:54,279
You're right, Yakup Bey. For the
sake of these whims, many tribes

928
01:38:54,440 --> 01:38:57,239
and many soldiers were ruined.

929
01:38:57,760 --> 01:39:01,719
The state of Seljuks was a shield
for Turkmens and it was destroyed.

930
01:39:01,800 --> 01:39:04,879
Now it is harder for the tribes.

931
01:39:04,960 --> 01:39:10,879
if Allah permits, we will get rid of
the troubles with Osman Bey.

932
01:39:11,600 --> 01:39:17,919
And I want to talk to you about this matter, Beys.

933
01:39:18,320 --> 01:39:25,399
I know that Osman Bey called you to obey.

934
01:39:25,800 --> 01:39:29,199
Do not obey Osman.

935
01:39:32,880 --> 01:39:38,239
You were the one who told us to
unite. Why are you objecting now?

936
01:39:40,240 --> 01:39:44,599
Because I don't want you to

937
01:39:44,680 --> 01:39:48,719
be ruined for the sake of his goals, Halil Bey.

938
01:39:48,880 --> 01:39:52,479
What should we do?

939
01:39:53,200 --> 01:39:56,719
Obey me.

940
01:39:59,280 --> 01:40:03,119
Only I have the power to

941
01:40:03,520 --> 01:40:05,799
become a shield for the Turkmens.

942
01:40:07,360 --> 01:40:13,519
My treasure is ten times larger than Osman's.

943
01:40:13,920 --> 01:40:20,119
My alps are ten times more than Osman's.

944
01:40:21,840 --> 01:40:24,719
-Kanyumaz.
Yes, my Sultan.

945
01:40:25,480 --> 01:40:26,199
Alps.

946
01:40:47,360 --> 01:40:52,439
If you bow down to Osman..

947
01:40:52,960 --> 01:40:56,679
..you will break in misery.

948
01:40:57,200 --> 01:41:01,039
If you stand beside me..

949
01:41:01,680 --> 01:41:05,679
..you will get richer..

950
01:41:06,240 --> 01:41:10,999
..and prevail with my gold.

951
01:41:42,000 --> 01:41:44,799
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

952
01:41:44,920 --> 01:41:48,119
Comeon, it is time for wedding.

953
01:42:15,120 --> 01:42:17,679
I do not feel it.

954
01:42:25,040 --> 01:42:27,439
It is stroke, mother.

955
01:42:28,120 --> 01:42:33,119
It starts with your arm now, and Allah
forbid, it can spread to your body tomorrow.

956
01:42:35,400 --> 01:42:38,639
You need to go to healing house at once.

957
01:42:38,800 --> 01:42:42,359
Do not say anything to
anyone until the wedding is over.

958
01:42:42,440 --> 01:42:46,799
Especially not to my Orhan. When the time comes..

959
01:42:47,080 --> 01:42:49,439
..I will tell Osman Bey.

960
01:42:50,960 --> 01:42:54,799
-Are you alright?
-I am alright.

961
01:42:59,160 --> 01:43:02,959
Come on.

962
01:43:06,320 --> 01:43:09,239
What we've heard was true, Ibrahim Bey.

963
01:43:09,320 --> 01:43:13,519
Alaeddin and Gonca Hatun love each other.

964
01:43:14,000 --> 01:43:17,319
-Everyone knew about it.
-It was apparent, mother.

965
01:43:17,880 --> 01:43:20,599
We will make our move accordingly.

966
01:43:21,160 --> 01:43:25,199
We will not make any moves, Hatun.

967
01:43:25,760 --> 01:43:27,999
Ahmet!

968
01:43:28,840 --> 01:43:33,719
You are marrying Gonca because of duty.

969
01:43:33,800 --> 01:43:37,999
This is a State matter not a heart matter.

970
01:43:38,080 --> 01:43:41,559
-Do not forget.
-I know that, father.

971
01:43:43,520 --> 01:43:46,239
What if Osman's son tries to do something bad?

972
01:43:46,440 --> 01:43:51,879
-What if he takes away the girl?
-Hatun!

973
01:43:53,120 --> 01:43:54,799
Osman Bey..

974
01:43:54,920 --> 01:43:59,279
..would not allow such madness.

975
01:44:01,600 --> 01:44:06,959
All Turks would go against each other..

976
01:44:07,280 --> 01:44:10,199
..and he knows this.

977
01:44:10,400 --> 01:44:15,279
Right. He does not have the heart to do that.

978
01:44:15,360 --> 01:44:20,759
If he does such a thing, we
would make him pay, mother.

979
01:44:23,000 --> 01:44:28,039
Come on, let us leave. It is time for the wedding.

980
01:44:59,000 --> 01:45:01,839
You came here from far away..

981
01:45:02,480 --> 01:45:05,639
..to witness this glorious day of ours.

982
01:45:06,040 --> 01:45:09,919
-May you prevail!
-Thank you, Osman Bey

983
01:45:10,040 --> 01:45:13,359
May our Allah protect..

984
01:45:13,640 --> 01:45:17,959
..our relation for eternity, if Allah permits.
-If Allah permits!

985
01:45:21,880 --> 01:45:26,599
The marriage of my daughter
Elcim and my son Orhan..

986
01:45:27,560 --> 01:45:32,919
..will unite Gunduz Bey's and our tribe.

987
01:45:34,080 --> 01:45:39,199
I wish from my Allah..

988
01:45:40,240 --> 01:45:46,399
..to have the same unity with other
Beyliks, and not only against infidels.

989
01:45:46,960 --> 01:45:51,119
But against each other as well.

990
01:45:52,800 --> 01:45:55,959
Of course, we want to be one..

991
01:45:56,200 --> 01:46:01,239
..against the infidels. However..

992
01:46:02,960 --> 01:46:08,159
..anyways.

993
01:46:09,360 --> 01:46:13,399
Now, we can move onto the wedding of our children.

994
01:46:13,560 --> 01:46:19,519
Come on, my children.

995
01:46:47,000 --> 01:46:52,359
Elcim Hatun, daughter of Gunduz Bey.

996
01:46:52,480 --> 01:46:56,399
Do you take Shahzade Orhan Bey son of Osman Bey..

997
01:46:56,720 --> 01:47:02,919
..as your husband for five hundred dirham?

998
01:47:07,400 --> 01:47:10,519
-I do.
Do you?

999
01:47:11,000 --> 01:47:14,919
-I do.
Do you?

1000
01:47:15,200 --> 01:47:17,319
-I do.

1001
01:47:17,880 --> 01:47:22,039
Shahzade Orhan Bey, son of Osman Bey.

1002
01:47:22,200 --> 01:47:24,759
Do you take Elcim Hatun, daughter of Gunduz Bey..

1003
01:47:24,880 --> 01:47:29,759
..as your wife for five hundred dirham?

1004
01:47:42,440 --> 01:47:45,119
I do.

1005
01:47:48,080 --> 01:47:51,959
-Holofira?
-Orhan?

1006
01:47:52,080 --> 01:47:55,559
-Do you?
-I do.

1007
01:47:57,160 --> 01:47:59,719
-Do you?
-I do.

1008
01:47:59,800 --> 01:48:01,879
May Allah bless you both.

1009
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:05,879
Oh Creator, the creator of the universe.
You have the grandness.

1010
01:48:06,000 --> 01:48:11,039
O, our Creator, protect our
children and our peers from harm.

1011
01:48:11,200 --> 01:48:15,199
-May You glorify this marriage.
-Ameen.

1012
01:48:15,360 --> 01:48:20,439
May You have us follow good
people who walk in the name of Allah.

1013
01:48:20,640 --> 01:48:26,399
-Ameen.
-Al Fatiha.

1014
01:48:41,200 --> 01:48:45,399
-May Allah bless it.
-Aameen.

1015
01:48:50,480 --> 01:48:55,679
Well... May Allah bless it.
-If Allah permits.

1016
01:48:56,160 --> 01:48:58,639
-ıf Allah permits, my Bey.
-May Allah give you...

1017
01:48:58,680 --> 01:49:00,799
...happiness both here and in afterlife.

1018
01:49:00,800 --> 01:49:06,439
Thank you. May Allah give you a long life.

1019
01:49:24,080 --> 01:49:27,159
Well, son..

1020
01:49:32,640 --> 01:49:37,679
May Allah never let taste the defeat.

1021
01:49:43,120 --> 01:49:46,999
Thank you, son. Thank you.

1022
01:49:51,280 --> 01:49:55,799
-Gunduz Bey.
-May Allah bless it.

1023
01:49:58,200 --> 01:50:00,359
I buried my son.

1024
01:50:00,880 --> 01:50:06,199
But Allah gave me another valiant son.

1025
01:50:07,000 --> 01:50:11,719
I trust you for my daughter
and trust my daughter for you.

1026
01:50:16,680 --> 01:50:22,239
Thank you, Gunduz Bey.
I will never fail your trust.

1027
01:50:38,480 --> 01:50:43,999
-May your love increase more and more, I hope.
-I hope so.

1028
01:50:49,080 --> 01:50:53,279
-Mother Bala.
-May it be blessed, son.

1029
01:50:53,520 --> 01:50:56,119
Thank you, Mother Bala.

1030
01:50:56,560 --> 01:51:00,079
-May your happiness last forever, if Allah permits.
-if Allah permits.

1031
01:51:00,240 --> 01:51:03,039
Come.

1032
01:51:04,040 --> 01:51:06,759
My mother gave me this necklace.

1033
01:51:06,800 --> 01:51:10,199
I hope you give it to
your daughter-in-law.

1034
01:51:10,211 --> 01:51:11,879
It's an honor for me.

1035
01:51:17,120 --> 01:51:19,799
-Brother.
-Brother.

1036
01:51:19,840 --> 01:51:23,719
-May Allah bless it, brother.
-Thank you.

1037
01:51:28,880 --> 01:51:32,359
-May it be well and blessed.
-Aameen.

1038
01:51:41,280 --> 01:51:43,959
Congratulations, Osman Bey.

1039
01:51:44,280 --> 01:51:47,759
You've seen your son get married.

1040
01:51:48,720 --> 01:51:51,439
May your wedding bring good luck...

1041
01:51:52,040 --> 01:51:54,759
...to both of the beylics.

1042
01:51:55,120 --> 01:52:00,639
Osman Bey, Gunduz Bey...
if Allah permits this marriage will be enough...

1043
01:52:00,960 --> 01:52:04,399
...to provide the unity that you desire.

1044
01:52:04,480 --> 01:52:06,559
If Allah permits.

1045
01:52:10,880 --> 01:52:15,159
Thank you. Thank you.

1046
01:52:15,560 --> 01:52:20,759
Not only two Kayi beylics...

1047
01:52:21,880 --> 01:52:27,199
...but, if Allah permits, all the beylics
will be united with us as well.

1048
01:52:27,360 --> 01:52:29,559
If Allah permits.

1049
01:52:33,160 --> 01:52:37,159
It's time now.

1050
01:53:04,360 --> 01:53:06,639
I've heard...

1051
01:53:07,120 --> 01:53:12,599
...that you are the most
powerful tradesmen of Kayi.

1052
01:53:12,680 --> 01:53:15,439
Yes, that's right.

1053
01:53:15,640 --> 01:53:20,119
We have control not only in this
market but also all the markets.

1054
01:53:20,760 --> 01:53:24,759
Osman made you rich.

1055
01:53:30,240 --> 01:53:32,959
Who are you?

1056
01:53:41,120 --> 01:53:46,199
I told you this while inviting you to
the wedding. No gifts will be accepted...

1057
01:53:47,280 --> 01:53:50,519
...from the tribe beys.

1058
01:53:50,960 --> 01:53:54,039
The only thing to be accepted...

1059
01:53:56,040 --> 01:53:59,479
...is loyalty for the fight.

1060
01:54:31,080 --> 01:54:36,359
We don't pledge loyalty to the one
who leaves us alone with Crusaders...

1061
01:54:36,480 --> 01:54:39,359
...but the one who defeated Crusaders!

1062
01:54:49,680 --> 01:54:54,999
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you.

1063
01:54:57,720 --> 01:55:01,639
Not to rot off but to have
conquests one after another

1064
01:55:01,840 --> 01:55:04,679
..we stand beside you, Osman Bey!

1065
01:55:09,480 --> 01:55:13,279
Thank you. Thank you.
Thank you. Thank you.

1066
01:55:18,360 --> 01:55:22,039
We don't worship the gold.

1067
01:55:22,880 --> 01:55:26,319
We are loyal to you, Osman Bey.

1068
01:55:31,640 --> 01:55:35,799
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you.

1069
01:55:36,400 --> 01:55:39,079
Thank you.

1070
01:55:42,720 --> 01:55:46,519
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Sure thing.

1071
01:55:55,080 --> 01:55:59,759
Glorious Beys of Turks! I thank you all!

1072
01:56:00,120 --> 01:56:02,559
The lands beyond our dreams will be ours...

1073
01:56:02,760 --> 01:56:06,759
...with the conquest fire in our hearts'

1074
01:56:07,120 --> 01:56:13,999
And it'll be a state under whose
shadow the oppressed feel at ease forever!

1075
01:56:14,800 --> 01:56:19,359
My Beys! My alps! My sisters!

1076
01:56:20,040 --> 01:56:24,079
This state will be worth...

1077
01:56:24,320 --> 01:56:26,839
...all the sufferings we endured.

1078
01:56:27,000 --> 01:56:30,959
-if Allah permits
-Long live Osman Bey!

1079
01:56:31,240 --> 01:56:37,399
Long live Osman Bey! Long live
Osman Bey! Long live Osman Bey!

1080
01:56:37,400 --> 01:56:39,879
He's intimidating us.

1081
01:56:39,920 --> 01:56:43,679
I'll burn all the mountains down on him!

1082
01:56:43,760 --> 01:56:54,159
Long live Osman Bey! Long live
Osman Bey! Long live Osman Bey!

1083
01:57:48,840 --> 01:57:54,719
Burn the market. Nobody will see the morning.

1084
01:59:57,280 --> 01:59:59,999
May I come in, Holofira?

1085
02:00:00,640 --> 02:00:03,839
Sure. Come in.

1086
02:00:09,680 --> 02:00:11,879
What's the hurry, Alaaddin?

1087
02:00:11,960 --> 02:00:15,719
Gonca... We'll take Gonca away, Holofira.

1088
02:00:18,120 --> 02:00:21,239
The tradition of Oghuz has been served.

1089
02:00:21,680 --> 02:00:26,679
Thank you for being with
us on this happy day of ours.

1090
02:00:26,960 --> 02:00:28,679
Thank you!

1091
02:00:29,040 --> 02:00:34,519
May our family prosper with more children!

1092
02:00:34,840 --> 02:00:38,959
Draw your swords and hit the shields!

1093
02:00:39,120 --> 02:00:42,439
Come on, alps!

1094
02:02:19,840 --> 02:02:23,079
What did Orhan Bey do?

1095
02:02:23,200 --> 02:02:26,799
He set a big table for a wedding.

1096
02:02:26,920 --> 02:02:29,599
Come on!

1097
02:02:29,720 --> 02:02:35,239
He did many things to make Elcim Hatun happy!

1098
02:02:35,280 --> 02:02:39,719
He sacrificed sheep and rams.

1099
02:02:39,920 --> 02:02:44,119
Did he hurt anyone? Did he say evil words?

1100
02:02:44,240 --> 02:02:47,679
He didn't hurt anyone. He didn't say evil words.

1101
02:02:47,760 --> 02:02:50,719
He married Elcim Hatun!

1102
02:02:50,840 --> 02:02:54,719
Then, may Allah make them happy!

1103
02:02:54,920 --> 02:02:59,239
Aameen!

1104
02:03:06,840 --> 02:03:08,799
Holofira, are you alright?

1105
02:03:09,120 --> 02:03:11,759
-Let's go.
-Alright.

1106
02:03:14,160 --> 02:03:18,279
-Do I have permission, my Shahzade?
-Come in, Dogan.

1107
02:03:22,520 --> 02:03:27,159
My Shahzade, Alaaddin Bey
is leaving the tribe with a hatun.

1108
02:03:29,560 --> 02:03:32,599
What are you up to, Alaaddin?

1109
02:03:32,960 --> 02:03:36,439
Prepare the horses, Dogan. We're following them.

1110
02:03:38,480 --> 02:03:41,439
I hope you aren't doing
what is in my mind, Alaaddin.

1111
02:03:41,680 --> 02:03:44,599
Otherwise, nobody can save you from me.

1112
02:04:29,320 --> 02:04:32,239
As Kayi's children...

1113
02:04:32,520 --> 02:04:35,919
...we did our duty.

1114
02:04:36,960 --> 02:04:40,439
We united two Kayi tribes.

1115
02:04:41,800 --> 02:04:44,039
May our union and strength...

1116
02:04:44,840 --> 02:04:50,719
..last long, if Allah permits.
-I hope so.

1117
02:05:14,120 --> 02:05:16,839
Malhun..

1118
02:05:17,000 --> 02:05:20,479
I know, nothing is more
important than finding the cure.

1119
02:05:20,640 --> 02:05:25,439
But... roads are too dangerous.

1120
02:05:25,520 --> 02:05:27,239
I cannot let you go there alone.

1121
02:05:27,480 --> 02:05:31,039
People need you here, my
Osman. The frontiers are in danger.

1122
02:05:31,080 --> 02:05:33,999
Besides, our enemies will
take advantage of your absence.

1123
02:05:34,000 --> 02:05:37,839
Don't worry. I will heal and
come back with Allah's consent.

1124
02:05:37,920 --> 02:05:42,959
You will heal, you
will... I know, but..

1125
02:05:46,360 --> 02:05:50,719
Only our children will know this.

1126
02:05:51,480 --> 02:05:54,559
You will leave in disguise.

1127
02:05:55,120 --> 02:05:58,719
Whatever makes you feel relieved.

1128
02:07:01,720 --> 02:07:05,359
Stay here.

1129
02:07:09,520 --> 02:07:13,799
Holofira Hatun. What are you doing here?

1130
02:07:14,320 --> 02:07:17,079
I am leaving, Gokmen Alp.

1131
02:07:17,200 --> 02:07:20,759
And before I go, I want to say goodbye to Gonca.

1132
02:07:21,000 --> 02:07:25,199
No. Yakup Bey ordered us. I cannot let you in.

1133
02:07:26,240 --> 02:07:31,799
-Then... give this to her, alright?
-Alright.

1134
02:07:35,720 --> 02:07:39,639
What are you doing, Hatun?

1135
02:08:08,720 --> 02:08:11,039
My Gonca! -Alaeddin!
-I arrived my rose!

1136
02:08:11,160 --> 02:08:15,199
I arrived, my Gonca. I will save you. -Holofira.

1137
02:08:17,320 --> 02:08:19,719
Are you alright? -I am.

1138
02:08:19,880 --> 02:08:22,999
But if Alps hear this, they will kill you Alaeddin.

1139
02:08:23,080 --> 02:08:27,279
We will have left until they wake up, don't worry.

1140
02:08:30,960 --> 02:08:36,119
Come on Holofira. Doesn't it open?
-I will open it,I am trying.

1141
02:08:36,520 --> 02:08:39,519
Alaeddin... My father...

1142
02:08:39,800 --> 02:08:41,959
No. Don't worry.

1143
02:08:42,400 --> 02:08:47,679
We will find a way. We
will tire them with our love.

1144
02:08:50,680 --> 02:08:54,759
Come on. Come on, let's leave.

1145
02:08:55,160 --> 02:08:58,199
Walk! -Alaeddin!

1146
02:08:58,840 --> 02:09:03,079
Stand back.
-I knew you would do something stupid.

1147
02:09:03,520 --> 02:09:07,879
If someone ever tries to abduct
my Hatun, I will surely kill him!

1148
02:09:08,920 --> 02:09:11,079
You should not have done this.

1149
02:09:11,280 --> 02:09:13,479
I will cut your tongue off, Ahmet!

1150
02:09:13,680 --> 02:09:15,719
Whose Hatun is she, huh? Whose Hatun?

1151
02:09:15,800 --> 02:09:20,039
Is it in manhood to set your sights
on a woman who loves someone else?

1152
02:09:21,000 --> 02:09:23,079
Come at me... Come.

1153
02:09:29,160 --> 02:09:32,919
Alaeddin! Alaeddin, stop!

1154
02:09:33,280 --> 02:09:38,719
Stand back, Gonca.

1155
02:09:44,480 --> 02:09:48,839
Fight with me like a man, Ahmet.
-Like a man, huh?

1156
02:09:49,440 --> 02:09:52,959
Come.

1157
02:09:55,240 --> 02:09:58,439
Alaeddin!

1158
02:10:11,280 --> 02:10:15,119
Come at me.

1159
02:10:22,880 --> 02:10:26,479
Come. Come.

1160
02:10:26,960 --> 02:10:31,399
Did you call her your Hatun?

1161
02:10:33,400 --> 02:10:36,479
Stand up! Stand up!

1162
02:10:36,880 --> 02:10:39,519
She is the one I love..

1163
02:10:40,800 --> 02:10:44,719
Stand up! -Alaeddin!

1164
02:10:45,600 --> 02:10:47,839
Alaeddin

1165
02:10:48,120 --> 02:10:50,799
Alaeddin! -Gonca, stop!
-Alaeddin enough!

1166
02:10:50,960 --> 02:10:54,399
Enough! You are going to kill him! Stop!

1167
02:10:55,360 --> 02:10:59,039
If I had time, I would beat
you after waking you up.

1168
02:10:59,560 --> 02:11:03,799
But I don't have much time.
You are a lucky man, Ahmet.

1169
02:11:04,840 --> 02:11:08,279
Come on, walk. -Hurry.

1170
02:11:10,360 --> 02:11:15,479
Come on, hurry! This way! Walk!

1171
02:11:25,040 --> 02:11:27,079
Mother..

1172
02:11:28,200 --> 02:11:30,559
May Allah protect you.

1173
02:11:31,760 --> 02:11:34,039
My Orhan..

1174
02:11:36,880 --> 02:11:40,719
I am entrusting you to
Allah first, then to each other.

1175
02:11:40,880 --> 02:11:43,679
Don't worry about us, mother.

1176
02:11:45,920 --> 02:11:49,959
My angel daughter...

1177
02:11:50,120 --> 02:11:51,999
May Allah be with you.

1178
02:11:53,960 --> 02:11:59,279
Go and come back quickly, mother.
-May my Allah protect you.

1179
02:12:07,640 --> 02:12:11,639
Don't worry about us. Our children
are entrusted to me, Malhun.

1180
02:12:11,720 --> 02:12:13,639
I know.

1181
02:12:19,680 --> 02:12:23,199
Come on, my children.

1182
02:12:27,080 --> 02:12:30,439
Samil! -My Bey.

1183
02:12:32,000 --> 02:12:34,679
Now you will take Malhun Hatun...

1184
02:12:34,800 --> 02:12:38,079
..to the HatunAna healing place.

1185
02:12:38,680 --> 02:12:40,232
I trust you and our Alps.

1186
02:12:40,244 --> 02:12:43,999
I will protect your trust at
the cost of my life, my Bey.

1187
02:12:44,480 --> 02:12:48,159
Thank you

1188
02:12:54,000 --> 02:12:57,799
-My Osman...
-Malhun..

1189
02:12:58,320 --> 02:13:00,599
Now..

1190
02:13:00,800 --> 02:13:04,399
...I won't be with you on
the way. You will be alone.

1191
02:13:04,720 --> 02:13:07,759
But this will protect you.

1192
02:13:16,200 --> 02:13:19,679
Thank you, my Osman.

1193
02:13:22,040 --> 02:13:26,319
May my Allah protect you.
-You too.

1194
02:13:26,760 --> 02:13:30,959
You too. -Come on.

1195
02:13:31,720 --> 02:13:34,679
Come on.

1196
02:13:44,720 --> 02:13:48,799
You will pay for this, Alaeddin.

1197
02:13:49,880 --> 02:13:52,599
I will kill you.

1198
02:13:55,680 --> 02:14:01,119
Get the horses ready Dogan.
They kidnapped Gonca.

1199
02:14:06,840 --> 02:14:10,119
I'm talking to you, Dogan. Come on.

1200
02:14:11,040 --> 02:14:14,439
My Shahzade.

1201
02:14:16,960 --> 02:14:20,639
-Don't be in such a hurry.
-What are you doing here?

1202
02:14:20,760 --> 02:14:23,959
I'm in a hurry, move.

1203
02:14:56,040 --> 02:15:02,559
If that's the case, then I'll
send you to your hell quickly.

1204
02:15:13,360 --> 02:15:20,319
Candar, Germiyan, Kayi.

1205
02:15:22,960 --> 02:15:28,039
Each one of them wants to
enlarge their hunting ground.

1206
02:15:29,080 --> 02:15:33,839
All three of them tasted the blood.

1207
02:15:36,480 --> 02:15:39,519
While they are tearing each other apart,

1208
02:15:39,760 --> 02:15:44,919
Olcaytu will have their hunting grounds.

1209
02:15:57,440 --> 02:16:01,919
Osman. They are getting ready to leave.

1210
02:16:02,400 --> 02:16:06,439
Are we going to let them go
knowing that they will plot against us.

1211
02:16:06,600 --> 02:16:10,439
Alaeddin has not come yet.

1212
02:16:10,760 --> 02:16:15,519
Alaeddin will do what needs to be done.
Don't worry, he'll get back safe and sound.

1213
02:16:15,640 --> 02:16:19,759
I hope so. And then?

1214
02:16:20,160 --> 02:16:24,239
-They will eventually find out.
-Let it happen, Bala.

1215
02:16:24,440 --> 02:16:27,559
We will not be able to stop the enemy then,

1216
02:16:27,720 --> 02:16:30,319
but my son will be happy.

1217
02:16:31,240 --> 02:16:34,477
We are rejoicing as we did yesterday.

1218
02:16:35,959 --> 02:16:40,839
There's nothing to say about it.
They all start their own families.

1219
02:16:41,080 --> 02:16:47,397
That's right. That's right.

1220
02:16:48,040 --> 02:16:50,279
And Beys who took an oath for us...

1221
02:16:50,638 --> 02:16:54,558
...will form a wall for us in
between Candar and Germiyans.

1222
02:16:54,680 --> 02:16:57,798
We will need to be prepared for anything.

1223
02:16:57,920 --> 02:17:02,079
Let's see them off.

1224
02:17:02,280 --> 02:17:06,999
-Very well.
-May I come in, my Bey? - Come on in, Aykurt.

1225
02:17:10,840 --> 02:17:14,798
My Bey, they attacked Karacahisar market.

1226
02:17:14,879 --> 02:17:18,239
They slaughtered all the shopkeepers.

1227
02:17:23,879 --> 02:17:28,839
-What about the alps?
-Alps were martyred, my Bey.

1228
02:17:29,600 --> 02:17:34,558
-Who did this?
-We don't know, my Bey.

1229
02:17:52,558 --> 02:17:56,759
My Karacahisar market was attacked.

1230
02:18:01,400 --> 02:18:07,879
My alps, my merchants were murdered.

1231
02:18:10,400 --> 02:18:13,119
Among you

1232
02:18:13,840 --> 02:18:18,079
there are those who want to stop
my conquests through the trade.

1233
02:18:20,799 --> 02:18:26,999
Whoever is involved in
this will pay for it heavily.

1234
02:18:28,000 --> 02:18:30,239
What are you talking about Osman Bey?

1235
02:18:43,000 --> 02:18:47,199
We're close to the horses, they're
right behind that cliff, come on.

1236
02:18:47,320 --> 02:18:51,439
Alaeddin!

1237
02:18:51,920 --> 02:18:57,519
Stay together, don't split up.

1238
02:19:21,600 --> 02:19:26,599
When the jackal smells the hunt

1239
02:19:26,760 --> 02:19:29,558
it does not go without tearing its meat.

1240
02:19:29,959 --> 02:19:33,519
You are my hunt.

1241
02:19:34,400 --> 02:19:37,239
Who are you, dastard?

1242
02:19:44,638 --> 02:19:48,759
What kind of accusation is this, Osman Bey?

1243
02:19:50,480 --> 02:19:53,919
I've been talking openly
since you came, Ibrahim Bey.

1244
02:19:54,240 --> 02:19:57,999
My accusation is clear.

1245
02:19:58,080 --> 02:20:00,999
Whoever is involved

1246
02:20:01,080 --> 02:20:04,799
-will be punished.
-Neither Yakup Bey

1247
02:20:05,120 --> 02:20:08,599
nor I have anything to do with

1248
02:20:08,800 --> 02:20:12,079
your market and your merchants.

1249
02:20:12,200 --> 02:20:16,799
If you try to judge us without setting up a court,

1250
02:20:17,080 --> 02:20:20,159
you will be the one to pay the price, not us.

1251
02:20:20,560 --> 02:20:25,479
I'm the Bey and state here.

1252
02:20:27,480 --> 02:20:31,479
If there's a mistake about the justice

1253
02:20:32,120 --> 02:20:35,479
I'll be the judge...

1254
02:20:35,560 --> 02:20:37,599
...if needed.

1255
02:20:38,760 --> 02:20:41,879
If I find the culprit,

1256
02:20:42,080 --> 02:20:46,079
I'll be the one to punish him.

1257
02:20:57,640 --> 02:21:00,719
Yakup Bey!

1258
02:21:01,000 --> 02:21:04,879
Ibrahim Bey!

1259
02:21:07,280 --> 02:21:11,919
Ibrahim Bey, Ibrahim Bey.

1260
02:21:19,400 --> 02:21:22,919
What's going on?

1261
02:21:28,520 --> 02:21:31,199
Ibrahim Bey.

1262
02:21:31,520 --> 02:21:33,239
-What's this?
-Ahmet Bey.

1263
02:21:33,240 --> 02:21:35,999
-What’s this?
-Ahmet Bey.

1264
02:21:39,760 --> 02:21:43,399
Ahmet?

1265
02:22:24,840 --> 02:22:29,839
Ahmet!

1266
02:22:30,640 --> 02:22:35,799
Ahmet! Ahmet!

1267
02:22:36,640 --> 02:22:39,919
My son!

1268
02:22:41,000 --> 02:22:50,799
Ahmet! My son!

1269
02:22:52,840 --> 02:22:58,399
Ahmet, wake up! Please wake up, Ahmet!

1270
02:23:01,960 --> 02:23:06,079
Ahmet! Ahmet!

1271
02:23:09,840 --> 02:23:15,839
My son! Ahmet!

1272
02:23:21,960 --> 02:23:24,039
My son!

1273
02:23:24,440 --> 02:23:27,719
Who did this? Who?

1274
02:23:32,840 --> 02:23:37,799
Alaeddin Bey kidnapped Gonca Hatun.

1275
02:23:38,920 --> 02:23:41,559
And he killed Ahmet Bey.

1276
02:23:55,480 --> 02:24:00,599
What are you talking about?
What are you talking about?

1277
02:24:05,480 --> 02:24:11,359
Are you going to be our murderer?

1278
02:24:12,920 --> 02:24:16,639
You will pay for this!

1279
02:24:33,320 --> 02:24:37,799
Ahmet!

1280
02:24:47,440 --> 02:24:52,559
I don't believe that my son killed him.

1281
02:24:53,800 --> 02:24:57,519
And I don't buy this slander.

1282
02:25:01,920 --> 02:25:06,239
But Ibrahim Bey, if...

1283
02:25:08,840 --> 02:25:12,439
...If you're gonna swing your sword at me...

1284
02:25:13,280 --> 02:25:15,719
...get ready for the retaliation.

1285
02:25:23,495 --> 02:25:36,675
Visit turkision.com for more!